OL,3,ALegendary costume designer Bob Mackie
OL,4,Adies aged 87
OL,5,
OL,6,FBob Mackie, who designed dazzling
OL,7,Fcostumes for stars including Cher, Tina
OL,8,FTurner, Dolly Parton and Elton John has
OL,9,Fdied, aged 87.
OL,11,FThe US fashion designer, known as the
OL,12,F"Sultan of Sequins" for his sparkling
OL,13,Fcreations, won a Tony Award, nine Emmys
OL,14,Fand received three Oscar nominations
OL,15,Fduring his career.
OL,17,F"It is with a heavy heart that we share
OL,18,Fthe news that Mr Bob Mackie passed away
OL,19,Ftoday," a statement on his Instagram
OL,20,Faccount announced on Monday.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
