OL,3,ALegendary costume designer Bob Mackie
OL,4,Adies aged 87
OL,5,
OL,6,F"He lived his 87 years to the fullest,
OL,7,Ffulfilling his dream of being a Fashion
OL,8,Fand Costume Designer, which is all he
OL,9,Fever wanted to do," it added. "His
OL,10,Fgenius and extraordinary designs will
OL,11,Flive on forever, continuing to bring
OL,12,Fbeauty into this world."
